OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 38, dies after three-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash in Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man has died following a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash on the A68 in the
OL,8,FScottish Borders.
OL,10,FThe accident happened near St Boswells
OL,11,Fat about 21:00 on Saturday and involved
OL,12,Fa white Ford Transit, a green Suzuki
OL,13,FSX4 and a white Honda ZR-V.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,16,F38-year-old driver of the Ford Transit
OL,17,Flater died in hospital.
OL,19,FThe 62-year-old female driver of the
OL,20,FSuzuki sustained a serious injury and
OL,21,Fthe 66-year-old male driver of the
OL,22,FHonda suffered minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
